<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose 12 points to 1,515.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose 12 points to 1,515.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,515 today from 1,503 on March 20, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1521    13.813	  1505    13.664</p>
<p>   1a   1546 11713.000	  1527 11564.000</p>
<p>   2    1812    25.888	  1795    25.643</p>
<p>   2a   1894 15531.000	  1869 15329.000</p>
<p>   3    1733    15.988	  1707    15.750</p>
<p>   3a   1623 12806.000	  1607 12686.000</p>
